        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 2174, Round Passage Mortise Pocket Door Hardware</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis Round Passage Pocket Door Set comes packaged with two pulls--one for each side of the door--a mortise box, and all the mounting hardware. It has a contemporary appearance that makes it a great choice for almost any home renovation. Perfect for pocket doors, the Emtek made 2174 Round Passage Mortise Pocket Door Hardware is installed by mortising it into the door. Choose from a wide array of beautiful finishes. It will fit doors that are 1-3/8 inches thick. The oval trim plates are 1/8 inches thick.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Pocket Door Passage Function:</b> This set neither locks nor latches. It features two flush pulls and a mortise box with a built in finger edge pull to help retrieve the door from the pocket.\r\n</p> \r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching: <a href=\"https://door-hardware-inc.myshopify.com/products/round-pocket-door-mortise-privacy-lock-emtek-2175\"><b>Round Pocket Door Privacy Set</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Passage Round Sliding Door Trim:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Face Plate Diameter: 2-7/8\"</li>\r\n\r\n<li>Face Plate Projection: 1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Box Height: 6-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Box Depth: 3-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Box Face Plate Height: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Box Face Plate Width: 7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Finger Grab Dimensions: 7/8\"w x 2\"h</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Finger Pull: is thrown by pressing the button on the mortise's face plate. It can be retracted simply by pressing it flush with the faceplate.</li>\r\n<li>Non-handed</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-2174-Specifications.pdf?v=1718159602\"><b>Emtek 2174 Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold as a Set:</b> two (2) oval flush pulls, a passage set mortise pull, and all mounting hardware. <b>For One (1) Door.</b>\r\n</p>",
